            <field>
              <name>MATCH</name>
              <description>ARMv8-M match type: 0 disabled, 1 cycle counter (comparator 0), 2 instruction address, 3 instruction address limit (with the previous comparator forms a range), 4 data address, 5 data address limit, 6 data address with data value (linked to the next comparator), 7 data address limit with value, 8 data value, 9 data address linked (for the value in the next comparator), 10 data address with value linked, 11-15 further data-value/range combinations. See the ARMv8-M ARM DWT_FUNCTION table and ID for what this comparator supports.</description>
