            <field>
              <name>ID</name>
              <description>Read-only capability ID of this comparator: which MATCH types (cycle counter, instruction address, data address, data value, linked/limit) it supports - see the DWT_FUNCTION.ID table in the ARMv8-M ARM.</description>
